		<Meldungstext>\T\Y\F\J\N Y\Y\S\J\NZ\L\S\K\N \L\S\G\A\INote:\L\S\K\N

0 = Compressor ON
 1-18 = Compressor OFF\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor ON:\L\S\K\I
 (\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvent\L\S\K\I condition)\L\S\K\A
 0\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOK\L\S\K\I - A/C system turned on, all requirements met;\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor OFF:\L\S\K\I
 (\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvent\L\S\K\I condition)\L\S\K\A
 1\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\Iexcess press.\L\S\K\I - coolant press. too high: p \L\S\K\N&gt;\L\S\K\I 32 bar;\L\S\K\A
 2\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IBlower\L\S\K\I - Blower faulty and act. voltage &lt; 3 V;\L\S\K\A
 3\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ILow pressure\L\S\K\I - Coolant pressure too low, thresholds depending on outside temp.,
Outside temperature p \L\S\K\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 2 bar;\L\S\K\A
 6\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IECON\L\S\K\I - ECON operation;\L\S\K\A
 7\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IA/C system OFF\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
 8\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOutside temperaturer\L\S\K\I - outside temperature too low, outside temperature \L\S\K\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 3.0°C;\L\S\K\A
 9\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IBlower off\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
 10\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ILow voltage\L\S\K\I - Veh. power supply too low, (T. 15) &lt; 10.1 V;\L\S\K\A
 11\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IHot lamp shutoff\L\S\K\I - Engine temperature &gt; 118°C;\L\S\K\A
 12\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IShutoff by ECM\L\S\K\I - Reason may be engine temperature, coolant for control module, Kick-down (info via CAN);\L\S\K\A
 13\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IExcess voltage\L\S\K\I - Vehicle power supply too high (T.. 15) &gt; 17 V;\L\S\K\A
 14\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvaporator temperature, risk of freezing\L\S\K\I - Evaporator temperatur too low;\L\S\K\A
 16\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ICompressor activation\L\S\K\I - error in activation path, e.g, open circuit/short-circuit to B+;\L\S\K\A
 17\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IPressure sensor\L\S\K\I - no or implausible signal from pressure sensor (PWM signal);\L\S\K\A
 18\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IVehicle power shutoff via control module \L\S\K\I;</Meldungstext>
